      {
        "id": "the-repair-was-not-the-only-question-hidden-carbon-damage-could-be-extensive",
        "title": "The repair was not the only question. Hidden carbon damage could be extensive.",
        "description": "With low compression and carbon build-up, the specialist could not know whether the piston rings had seized or the bores had been scored without a full strip-down.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": "h3",
            "id": "",
            "text": "Path A"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Full strip-down and inspection of existing engine — 10 hours labour (£650–£800). Then repair or replace based on findings."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
